"Airport KPI dashboards"},{"text":"Baggage performance"},{"text":"Gate utilisation"},{"text":"Workforce planning"},{"text":"Customer complaints"},{"text":"Flight punctuality"},{"text":"Operational efficiency"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This can eventually move the graduate from purely frontline operations into aviation operations analytics and management."}]},{"heading":"Important Airport KPIs to Understand","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn the meaning of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"On-Time Performance (OTP)"},{"text":"Turnaround Time"},{"text":"Passenger Throughput"},{"text":"Gate Utilisation"},{"text":"Baggage Delivery Time"},{"text":"Mishandled Baggage Rate"},{"text":"Aircraft Utilisation"},{"text":"Connection/Transfer Performance"},{"text":"Queue Waiting Time"},{"text":"Flight Delay"},{"text":"Cancellation Rate"},{"text":"Customer Satisfaction"},{"text":"Service-Level Agreement (SLA)"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understanding these metrics makes a candidate much stronger for operations-management roles."}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Options in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A PG degree is not required to become ground staff."},{"type":"p","text":"It becomes useful for management and specialised career progression."},{"type":"h","text":"Strong options"},{"type":"h","text":"MBA Aviation Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Best for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airport management"},{"text":"Airline management"},{"text":"Aviation strategy"},{"text":"Commercial aviation"},{"text":"Operations leadership"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MBA Operations"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airport operations"},{"text":"Ground handling"},{"text":"Logistics"},{"text":"Process management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MBA Logistics & Supply Chain"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cargo"},{"text":"Airport logistics"},{"text":"Aviation supply chain"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MBA Business Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airport analytics"},{"text":"Airline analytics"},{"text":"Revenue analytics"},{"text":"Operations analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MBA Marketing"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airline marketing"},{"text":"Airport commercial operations"},{"text":"Customer experience"},{"text":"Aviation sales"}]}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad Options","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Potential postgraduate areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aviation Management"},{"text":"Airport Management"},{"text":"Airline Management"},{"text":"Air Transport Management"},{"text":"Aviation Safety"},{"text":"Airport Planning"},{"text":"Logistics & Supply Chain"},{"text":"Transportation Management"},{"text":"Aviation Business Analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Countries commonly associated with aviation-management education include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UK"},{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"UAE"},{"text":"Singapore"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For international study, verify current programme eligibility, aviation-industry placement opportunities, work rights, tuition and visa rules before choosing a programme."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"0–2 Years"},{"type":"h","text":"Ground Staff / Passenger Service Executive"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Passenger handling"},{"text":"Check-in"},{"text":"Boarding"},{"text":"Customer service"},{"text":"Airport systems"},{"text":"Safety"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2–5 Years"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Executive / Supervisor"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Team coordination"},{"text":"Operational KPIs"},{"text":"Shift management"},{"text":"Incident handling"},{"text":"Process improvement"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5–8 Years"},{"type":"h","text":"Duty 