ion management"},{"text":"Airport congestion prediction"},{"text":"Safety monitoring"},{"text":"Operational decision support"}]},{"type":"p","text":"But human skills remain important because airport operations involve:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Safety"},{"text":"Emergencies"},{"text":"Passenger interaction"},{"text":"Conflict resolution"},{"text":"Operational judgement"},{"text":"Multi-team coordination"}]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Core Aviation"},{"type":"p","text":"Airport Operations\nGround Handling\nPassenger Services\nAircraft Turnaround\nAviation Safety\nAirport Security Awareness\nBaggage Operations"},{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"p","text":"Management\nOperations Management\nCustomer Experience\nBusiness Communication\nLeadership\nProblem Solving"},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"h","text":"Excel\nPower BI\nAirport/airline operational systems\nBasic SQL"},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"p","text":"English Communication\nProfessional Grooming\nConflict Resolution\nTeamwork\nShift Management\nCrisis Handling"}]},{"heading":"Ideal Graduate Profile","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong BBA Aviation Management graduate targeting ground operations should graduate with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"BBA/BMS/BBM in Aviation Management"},{"text":"1 aviation internship"},{"text":"3–5 aviation projects"},{"text":"Strong English communication"},{"text":"Customer-service skills"},{"text":"Airport operations knowledge"},{"text":"Ground-handling fundamentals"},{"text":"Aviation safety awareness"},{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Basic Power BI"},{"text":"Knowledge of airport systems"},{"text":"Professional interview skills"},{"text":"Ability to work in shifts"},{"text":"Understanding of airport KPIs"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Practical Path"},{"type":"h","text":"BBA Aviation Management"},{"type":"flow","items":["Aviation & airport fundamentals","Pas